OL,3,GNEWSAFuel leak spreads more than two
OL,4,Amiles along River Taff
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been advised to keep their
OL,7,Fwindows and doors shut due to a
OL,8,Fwidespread fuel leak in the River Taff.
OL,10,FKerosene has spread down almost 2.5
OL,11,Fmiles (4km) of the river, Natural
OL,12,FResources Wales (NRW), has said.
OL,14,FIt was first reported to be affecting
OL,15,Fat least one mile (1.6km) of the river
OL,16,Fon Saturday morning, then NRW later
OL,17,Fsaid it had spread as it continued "to
OL,18,Finvestigate the source of the incident
OL,19,Fto understand how it is happening, stop
OL,20,Fthe pollution completely and collect
OL,21,Fevidence".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
