OL,3,GNEWSAFuel leak spreads more than two
OL,4,Amiles along River Taff
OL,5,
OL,6,FEurig Thomas, a resident in Taff's
OL,7,FWell, Rhondda Cyon Taff, said: "It
OL,8,Fsmelt like a petrol station, it hit you
OL,9,Fas soon as you came out."
